— STICKERS: put a sticker on any memory in your feed, from the mood packs or from your own moods. You both can add them, and they show up in Your book too.

— YOUR OWN MOODS are now a separate set. Draw a new one with your finger right on the sheet, or make it from an emoji or your photo.

— ACHIEVEMENTS are drawn anew and animated. A new one opens in a sheet from the bottom, and all of them stand on shelves.

— Screens unfold from the button you tapped, photos fly into the full-screen view, and the chest flies from the home screen to its own screen.

— A new time capsule: you write your letter on a sheet, and in the feed the capsule sits under a seal counting the days until it opens.

— With Togetherly+ your profile banner can be a GIF.

— A gift from the chest goes to your partner with a note.

— 18+ memories are blurred in thumbnails too, and they stay out of “On this day” and widgets. They go into Your book only if you turn the switch on.

— Fixed: photos and avatars appear right away from your phone’s storage, even offline, and the app uses less data. The screen no longer goes dark in the middle of a video, and Days Together counts from the date you set yourself.
